  "notes": [
    "User requested clearer adviser/company selector and navy views on 2026-10-30. Adviser window/card geometry and dedicated 96px cards are generated separately; original backgrounds remain unchanged.",
    "Use the existing dark-baked bsm_16_blk family on silver/white numeric counters and costs, retaining semantic tint while capping forced-white C++ text brightness.",
    "Dark admiral placeholder and ship rows retain white glyphs. Admiral label is shortened locally to two Japanese lines; portrait, controls, ship data and status graphics are preserved.",
    "Ship type x and width remain native because no-MTG C++ adjusts them dynamically. Names/types occupy separate 18px lines inside the 41px row.",
    "The centered 55px group banner is contained at y28; reserve 60px before cards so it cannot cover the selector subtitle or first row. White class icons and status bars receive a 34px navy backplate; numeric counts start outside it at x34."
  ]
}
